# Experiment outputs
# results/ is gitignored BY DEFAULT (run data, gitignored artifacts). Whitelisted
# below: design docs whose CONTENT is ours and which tracked code/configs cite as
# ratified authority (audit A1, maintainer-ruled 2026-09-01) — same rule as docs/prior_work/.
!results/
results/*
!results/d25/
results/d25/*
!results/d25/d25_amendment_r010b.md
!results/design_ch3/
results/design_ch3/*
!results/design_ch3/ch3_search_design_r2.md
!results/design_critic/
results/design_critic/*
!results/design_critic/r2_changelog.md
!results/design_fp_gap/
results/design_fp_gap/*
!results/design_fp_gap/ch4_synthesis.md
!results/design_fp_gap/revision_log.md
!results/design_ladder_r4/
results/design_ladder_r4/*
!results/design_ladder_r4/BRIEF.md
!results/design_ladder_r4/mem_A.md
!results/design_ladder_r4/mem_B.md
